+# Phase 14.5.51.1 — In-App Language & Theme Controls
+
+## Objective
+Expose the already-supported Arabic/English resources and Dark/Light theme as clear in-app choices.
+
+## Changes
+- Add Arabic and English selection controls to the main navigation drawer.
+- Add Light and Dark selection controls to the same visible preferences area.
+- Persist both choices locally.
+- Apply language immediately to Compose resources and layout direction.
+- Preserve the existing top-app-bar theme shortcut.
+
+## Safety boundary
+- No business logic changes.
+- No database/schema/DAO changes.
+- No accounting, inventory, production, compensation, commission, authentication, permission, or backup behavior changes.
+
+Central integration still owns the final release version, migration ordering and signing.
